    <h1 class="msv-hero__title">Setting Up Utilities in Spain: Electricity, Gas, Water, and Internet</h1>
    <p class="msv-hero__intro">Setting up utilities in a new Spanish home can be more involved than expected. From navigating Spanish-language contracts to understanding the dual-rate electricity billing, new arrivals often encounter unexpected complexity. This guide walks you through each utility step by step.</p>
  </div>
